{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06969","headline":"春怨 · 崔亘","name":"春怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜尽梦初惊，纱窗早雾明。\n晓妆脂粉薄，春服绮罗轻。\n妾有今朝恨，君无旧日情。\n愁来理弦管，皆是断肠声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔亘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}